\* Active direct Source r38 translation; see the translation review for scope/evidence.
\* Hierarchy: Backend / Application boundary / Frontend / Portable build.
\* No new system FSM. Qualified imported methods use '_' mechanically.
\* activeProject below is an imported Backend binding, NOT a copied authority.
\* projection/actions/interfaceState/result are startup-call-local values.
CONSTANT NoValue

